            },
            "description": "<p> The <code>GetQualificationScore</code> operation returns the value of a Worker's Qualification for a given Qualification type. </p> <p> To get a Worker's Qualification, you must know the Worker's ID. The Worker's ID is included in the assignment data returned by the <code>ListAssignmentsForHIT</code> operation. </p> <p>Only the owner of a Qualification type can query the value of a Worker's Qualification of that type.</p>"
